  "diagnosis": "Stale JobArrayTaskLimit reason. Reapplying the existing ArrayTaskThrottle=5 clears it; after multiple scheduler cycles all three pending arrays show Priority. No jobs restarted, cancelled, held or resubmitted. Higher-priority jobs are pending in apollo.",
