  "technical_explanation": "In Slurm 23.02.7 job_array_start_test sets WAIT_ARRAY_TASK_LIMIT when the limit is reached but does not clear that reason after the count drops. The priority test sets WAIT_PRIORITY only when the old reason is WAIT_NO_REASON. A successful scontrol update clears the old non-held reason, allowing a fresh diagnosis. Observed on all three arrays: same throttle 5 before/after, reason changed to Priority and persisted across multiple backfill cycles.",
